From 454d7e54b943842f6325c77bd32b3b9ccc8ef7c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dlssg-to-xefg <dev@local>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:36:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Combine WMMA freeze fix, depth-stencil bridge fix, and 4 MFG
 perf/latency techniques

1. WMMA freeze fix (D3D12VulkanWmma.h/.cpp, D3D12VulkanWmmaOff.cpp, FrameGenerator.cpp):
   - Switch D3D12->Vulkan WMMA bridge submissions from Vulkan 1.0 vkQueueSubmit to
     Vulkan 1.3 vkQueueSubmit2 (synchronization2) to avoid OptiScaler's Vulkan_wDx12::hk_vkQueueSubmit hook.
   - Replace unbounded vkQueueWaitIdle calls with bounded vkWaitSemaphores timeouts and clean
     automatic fallback to D3D12 cs_6_6 overrides if the Vulkan queue stalls or times out.
   - Run Vulkan WMMA context creation/upload asynchronously via WarmupContextAsync() so
     FrameGenerator::CreateContext() never blocks Streamline's 500ms waitCPUFence deadline.

2. D3D12->Vulkan WMMA depth-stencil bridge fix (FrameGenerator.cpp, D3D12VulkanWmma.cpp):
   - Extract D32_FLOAT_S8X24 / R32G8X24_TYPELESS depth plane 0 into a shared R32_FLOAT
     Texture2D (CaptureDepth32Plane0) so UE5/DX12 depth buffers import into Vulkan WMMA.
   - Add extra DXGI->VkFormat mappings and one-shot GetOrImportLocked failure diagnostics.

3. 4 MFG performance & latency techniques (cuda_route.cpp, FrameGenerator.*, Plugin.*, VulkanPolicy.h, VulkanHost.cpp):
   - Persistent CUDA descriptor & per-layer launch replay cache.
   - Camera Cut & Teleport Detector (CameraCutDetection, default true).
   - Adaptive VRAM Guard with hysteresis (VramGuard, default true).
   - Auto VRR (Hz - 3) Pacer Cap & Queue-Pressure Guard (AutoVrrPacing, default false).
